  "lesson": "Under Guideline I, a security clearance can be denied when a mental‑health condition is diagnosed as impairing judgment and the required mitigating factors—especially sustained, documented treatment compliance—are not met. The presumption against granting clearance prevails unless clear, long‑term evidence of remission is presented.",
